    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Uncommon</em></p><p>This ceramic jug looks as if it holds a gallon of liquid, and it weighs 12 pounds whether it is full or empty. Shaking it makes a sloshing sound, even when it is empty.</p><p>You can take a Magic action and name one liquid from the Alchemy Jug Liquids table to make the jug produce that liquid. You can then uncork the jug as a Utilize action and pour out the liquid at up to 2 gallons per minute. How much of a liquid the jug can make depends on the liquid you named.</p><p>Once the jug starts producing a liquid, it can’t produce a different one, or more of one that has reached its maximum, until the next dawn.</p><p><strong>Alchemy Jug Liquids</strong></p><table><thead><tr><th>Liquid</th><th>Max. Amount</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagAcid0000000]{Acid}</td><td>8 ounces</td></tr><tr><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagPoisonBasic]{Basic Poison}</td><td>4 ounces</td></tr><tr><td>Beer</td><td>4 gallons</td></tr><tr><td>Honey</td><td>1 gallon</td></tr><tr><td>Mayonnaise</td><td>2 gallons</td></tr><tr><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagOil00000000]{Oil}</td><td>1 quart</td></tr><tr><td>Vinegar</td><td>2 gallons</td></tr><tr><td>Water, fresh</td><td>8 gallons</td></tr><tr><td>Water, salt</td><td>12 gallons</td></tr><tr><td>Wine</td><td>1 gallon</td></tr></tbody></table><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-2wIKEG7zvCHsUdhk\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>L’activité <em>Produce Liquid</em> compte le choix du liquide, rendu à l’aube ; les quantités versées se suivent à la main.</p></section>",
